{"articleNo":"85575","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=85575&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013 유럽박사과정설명회(promodoc) 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.21","hit":"3791","attachments":[{"name":"PromoDoc 2013-Doctoral studies in Europe_Korean.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85575&attachNo=71595"},{"name":"PromoDoc 2013-Doctoral studies in Europe_English.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85575&attachNo=71755"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">EU(유럽연합)이 유럽 박사과정 유학기회를 알리기 위해 개최하는 유럽박사과정설명회(promodoc)가 2013년 9월 28일 부터 우리나라에서 개최된다고 하니&nbsp;많은 참여 바랍니다</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 행사명 : 유럽 박사과정 설명회(p</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">romodoc)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">주요내용: 유럽대학에서 영어로 박사과정을 이수할 수 있는 기관 및 프로그램 소개, 현장 즉석 인터뷰 및 채용 동시 진행</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">기간/장소: </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- ′13.9.28.~29.(2일간)/한국외국어대학교</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- ′13.10.1.~2.(2일간)/ 부산대학교</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">문의처: 전화 02-735-7673, email korea@promodoc.eu</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 &nbsp;프로모독 행사 소개 자료(영문, 국문) 각 1부. &nbsp;끝.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
